          <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
            <td height="373"> 
              <p>
              <font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"> PMWATCH 
              -- March 1, 2002 -- Yet more horrorible proof of the IDF's criminal 
              practice of cold blooded killing of children. The case against the IDF
	     is massive, overwhelming, and yet, no outcries of disgust and outrage.
              To this date, no editorials have been written or expressions of indignation voiced 
              against the murder and the lies that have accompanied it trying 
              to cover it up. 
              </font></p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Please 
                spread this heart breaking photograph (link is provided below) by filling your contact info 
                and clicking "send". Ask them why they have not dispatched 
                their reporters to cover this story in-depth the way they send 
                those reporters to cover the victims of suicide bombings. And 
                why haven't they expressed their outrage over the outward policy 
                of killing children as a way of pressuring Palestinians to turn 
                against the Palestinian Authority, the way they rail against Arafat 
                and Hamas?</font>
              </font></p><p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">For other related calls, see:
              </font>
              </p><ul>
